    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello adventurers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start an exciting journey to the world of Dragons Reef in virtual reality. Choose one of eight captains and set off on your own ship into a fantasy world full of dragons, pirates, various sea creatures and gold to be won. Each captain has their own unique skills that give them an advantage in certain missions. Character skills can be developed to higher levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/235aff5bc21038f1c719bed1172ce5cd.poster.avif?t=1752523270\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/235aff5bc21038f1c719bed1172ce5cd.webm?t=1752523270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons Reef VR is a colorful action game in which you will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a recreational virtual reality experience of delivering goods with your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a spectacular naval combat in which the gameplay is about defending yourself from pirates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a thrilling chase after rogues stealing goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a dynamic gameplay in which the player must capture and hold control points to disable the shields of the opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an adventure of escorting allied ships to their destination while the pirates try to stop them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a satisfying gameplay of destroying pirate structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a game requiring dexterity and focus in which the player must bring as many barrels of energy to their base as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >two special levels of the game in which the player can take on the role of pirates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 long levels that can be played multiple times, the gameplay will look slightly different each time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 extraordinary artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different types of magical cannonballs, each with its own special properties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/da339af6a01c26d67d6027bfdff33fd1.poster.avif?t=1752523270\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/da339af6a01c26d67d6027bfdff33fd1.webm?t=1752523270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you can collect magic crystals, the extraordinary power of which will allow you to increase the level of your ship and unlock additional special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons Reef VR is not just a game, but also an amazing experience that will allow you to admire beautiful graphics and the possibilities offered by the latest technologies and virtual reality goggles. Immerse yourself in an amazing new world full of wonderful and fun gameplay and RPG game elements. Admire the cute animals and get your own dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/4e95e39ba7934b5b87bd35cd26ae3598.poster.avif?t=1752523270\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/4e95e39ba7934b5b87bd35cd26ae3598.webm?t=1752523270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling the ship is possible using both the Xbox controller and dedicated controllers for virtual reality goggles</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello adventurers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start an exciting journey to the world of Dragons Reef in virtual reality. Choose one of eight captains and set off on your own ship into a fantasy world full of dragons, pirates, various sea creatures and gold to be won. Each captain has their own unique skills that give them an advantage in certain missions. Character skills can be developed to higher levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/235aff5bc21038f1c719bed1172ce5cd.poster.avif?t=1752523270\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/235aff5bc21038f1c719bed1172ce5cd.webm?t=1752523270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons Reef VR is a colorful action game in which you will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a recreational virtual reality experience of delivering goods with your ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a spectacular naval combat in which the gameplay is about defending yourself from pirates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a thrilling chase after rogues stealing goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a dynamic gameplay in which the player must capture and hold control points to disable the shields of the opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an adventure of escorting allied ships to their destination while the pirates try to stop them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a satisfying gameplay of destroying pirate structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a game requiring dexterity and focus in which the player must bring as many barrels of energy to their base as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >two special levels of the game in which the player can take on the role of pirates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 long levels that can be played multiple times, the gameplay will look slightly different each time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 extraordinary artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different types of magical cannonballs, each with its own special properties</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/da339af6a01c26d67d6027bfdff33fd1.poster.avif?t=1752523270\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/da339af6a01c26d67d6027bfdff33fd1.webm?t=1752523270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game you can collect magic crystals, the extraordinary power of which will allow you to increase the level of your ship and unlock additional special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragons Reef VR is not just a game, but also an amazing experience that will allow you to admire beautiful graphics and the possibilities offered by the latest technologies and virtual reality goggles. Immerse yourself in an amazing new world full of wonderful and fun gameplay and RPG game elements. Admire the cute animals and get your own dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/4e95e39ba7934b5b87bd35cd26ae3598.poster.avif?t=1752523270\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765460/extras/4e95e39ba7934b5b87bd35cd26ae3598.webm?t=1752523270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling the ship is possible using both the Xbox controller and dedicated controllers for virtual reality goggles</p>",
    "short_description": "Start an exciting sailing adventure in virtual reality. Steer the ship, shoot cannons, transport goods, develop the skills of your captain. Use special skills and magical artifacts to defend the land of the dragon reef from pirates. VR, dragons, pirates, sea battles, fantasy, family friendly game",
